<title>CHINA: China air freight grows fastest of all cargo means.</title>
<headline>China air freight grows fastest of all cargo means.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's air freight business is growing faster than all other forms of cargo and passenger transportation, up 8.4 percent in the first four months of this year, the China Daily Business Weekly said on Sunday.</p>
<p>By contrast, passenger transportation in the country was up 5.1 percent while rail, truck and boat freight volume all fell marginally compared to the same period last year, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>A total of 380,200 tonnes of freight were shipped by air in the January-April period, it added.</p>
</text>
